# Play test of The Cartographer's Isles (CIPlay cartographers_isles, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe:
# the hut's pad at -39 -5 (2.5 m), its deck 3.9 m, its ladder at -39 -7.4; the knoll's path from 0 -4 up to the top at
# 10 -16 (12 m); the tower's pad at 50 20 (4.6 m), its ladder at 50.75 18.3, its deck 14.6 m; the drowned post at 34 22
# (6 m down); the sandbar at 1 m, the X at 18 35
island The Cartographer's Isles
offset 0.2268 0.4458
expect step 0
expect title Four Bearings
expect animals Llama 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden piece2
expect hidden treasure
wait 5

# The hut: the will, the map case - piece II shows on the knoll's pillar
walk -40.8 -11.6 to -39.6 -9.4 h=3.8
zone landing
expect step 1
read Ines Achterberg's will
expect step 2
climb -39 -7.4 h=2.5
expect stand -39 -5 h=3.9 below=6
open Map piece I
expect shown piece2
expect step 3
open Box under the hut

# The knoll: up the path to the pillar, its plate - piece III shows on the tower
walk 0 -4 to 0 -20 to 7 -20.5 to 9 -17.5 h=12
zone trig1
expect step 4
read Map piece II
expect shown piece3
expect step 5
open Cairn box

# The survey tower: up the ladder, piece III - the bottle shows at the drowned post
walk 50.75 15.4 to 50.75 17.6 h=4.6
climb 50.75 18.3 h=4.6
climb 50.75 18.3 h=7.02
climb 50.75 18.3 h=9.44
climb 50.75 18.3 h=11.86
climb 50.75 18.3 h=14.28
expect stand 50.75 20.6 h=14.6 below=16
zone trig2
expect step 6
read Map piece III
expect shown piece4
expect step 7
open Tower box

# The drowned post: the bottle - the X shows on the sandbar
zone trig3
expect step 8
read Map piece IV
expect shown digmound
expect step 9
open Sunk barrel

# The sandbar: the hyenas; the dig; the treasure
walk 12 30 to 16 33 h=1
zone xmark
expect step 10
kill Hyena
use digmound
expect hidden digmound
expect shown treasure
open Achterberg's treasure
expect done
